   "body": "/claim mac/i799\n\nPlan:\n- Add `outerMargin` / `innerMargin` to `ListDensity` (regular = system outer + 16 inner, compact = 10 + 7) and one `densityListMargins()` modifier.\n- Apply the modifier to every inset-grouped list that uses density (Favoris, Catégories, topic list, MP list, profile, archived drafts), live through the environment.\n- Tests on the values (red first), full app suite on one throwaway simulator.\n- Screenshots (fixtures only) regular vs compact, light/dark, iPhone and iPad.\n- Draft PR with a `gap-new` ledger row.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
